// 010.7: `Count(Foreach x: f(x))` constructs an instance for every domain element of `x` without
// testing whether `f(x)` holds, so it counts the whole domain (CHR039).
//! expect-warning: CHR039
Fact person Identified by Iris, Wren, Abel
Fact present Identified by person.
?Count(Foreach person: present(person)) == 3.
?Count(Foreach person: person When present(person)) == 0.
